<title>USA: TABLE-Penn Engineering Q2 net income falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Penn Engineering Q2 net income falls.</headline>
<dateline>DANBORO, Pa. 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Penn Engineering &amp; Manufacturing Corp</p>
<p>			  Three Months Ended	  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>		     June 30,     June 30,    June 30,    June 30,</p>
<p>			 1997	   1996	  1997	  1996</p>
<p>    Net Sales     $41,974	$41,482     $80,990     $80,511</p>
