<p>		     Amounts in Thousands, Except Per Share Data</p>
<p>NOTE: -- Today the Board of Directors increased the quarterly cash dividend to 11 cents per share, a ten percent increase, and declared a dividend payable October 7, 1997, to shareholders of record, September 15, 1997.</p>
